{"ref":"BDB, יָעֵף","hw":"יָעֵף","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יָעֵף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be weary, faint (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">وَغَفَ</span> <em>run</em> and <em>shew weariness</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיָעֵ֑פוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:58\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.58\">Je 51:58</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:64\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.64\">64</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִיעַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.28\">Is 40:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּעָ֑ף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.12\">44:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִֽעֲפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.30\">40:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִיעָ֑פוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.31\">31</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִעָ֑פוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.13\">Hb 2:13</a>;—<em>be</em> or <em>grow weary</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a> (in seeking); = exhaust oneself fruitlessly <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.13\">Hb 2:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יגע</span>), hence <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:58\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.58\">Je 51:58</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:64\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.64\">64</a> (repeated by error from v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:58\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.58\">58</a>); of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> (neg.); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.28\">Is 40:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יגע</span>); youth <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.30\">40:30</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); the god-fearing v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.31\">31</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <em>be faint</em> from lack of water <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.12\">44:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין כֹּחַ</span> from hunger).<br><strong>Hoph.</strong>  Pt. <em>wearied</e